        "description": {
            "value": "<p>For whatever personal reasons, you once took pleasure in the aggressive and deliberate provocation of strangers on the infosphere. You sought to provoke, upset, and perhaps even bring harm to others through inflammatory messages and posts. You might have grown out of this phase, but the skills stuck with you.</p>\n<p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Constitution</strong> or <strong>Charisma</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p>\n<p>You're trained in the Intimidation skill and the Infosphere Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.feats.Item.Cyberbully] skill feat.</p>"
